WEBVTT

00:01.550 --> 00:02.887
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.911 --> 00:04.246
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.270 --> 00:07.486
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.510 --> 00:13.070
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.070 --> 01:31.030
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.190 --> 01:34.430
=Episode 28=

01:38.705 --> 01:41.530
(Biography of Wu Su)

02:06.280 --> 02:07.280
Your Highness.

02:10.155 --> 02:11.155
Your Highness.

02:12.450 --> 02:13.450
Your Highness.

02:20.930 --> 02:21.980
Are you all right?

02:23.980 --> 02:24.980
Yes.

02:26.030 --> 02:27.610
I was just a bit dizzy.

02:28.880 --> 02:29.880
Oh.

02:30.255 --> 02:31.970
What do you think
this picture indicates?

02:33.655 --> 02:34.655
This picture

02:34.850 --> 02:35.755
has nothing to do

02:35.830 --> 02:37.410
with the text content.

02:37.530 --> 02:38.955
When you look at this picture,

02:39.580 --> 02:41.186
do you have any special feelings?

02:41.210 --> 02:42.705
It's just a normal picture.

02:45.630 --> 02:46.630
Never mind.

02:46.930 --> 02:48.090
Let's continue.

03:07.505 --> 03:09.010
It's you again!

03:20.030 --> 03:21.555
Is it you

03:22.805 --> 03:23.747
who gave him the wooden box?

03:23.771 --> 03:24.850
If I reply,

03:25.505 --> 03:26.690
will you let me climb up?

03:27.255 --> 03:28.370
You want to climb up

03:29.555 --> 03:30.347
and kill him?

03:30.371 --> 03:32.130
Or why would I take the trouble?

03:33.555 --> 03:34.555
No way.

03:34.955 --> 03:36.346
Too many people in Yangcheng
would notice me

03:36.370 --> 03:37.810
so I didn't want to fight you there.

03:37.905 --> 03:39.450
But things are different here.

03:40.555 --> 03:42.030
I advise you one last time.

03:43.255 --> 03:44.980
We can join hands

03:45.780 --> 03:47.050
to kill Xu Fengnian.

03:47.205 --> 03:48.255
Oh.

03:49.905 --> 03:50.905
Mm.

03:52.805 --> 03:53.805
But I don't want that.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.280
Miss,

04:03.730 --> 04:04.780
you should

04:05.730 --> 04:07.455
at least be reasonable!

04:10.805 --> 04:11.931
In this biography,

04:11.955 --> 04:14.055
many testimonies from witnesses
have been collected.

04:14.780 --> 04:15.570
That night,

04:15.730 --> 04:17.450
Wang Xianzhi was indeed in the capital.

04:19.805 --> 04:20.905
Not all testimonies

04:21.630 --> 04:22.970
are true.

04:24.005 --> 04:25.066
Witnesses mentioned in it

04:25.090 --> 04:26.131
are mostly alive.

04:26.155 --> 04:28.130
It's not hard to confirm.

04:29.305 --> 04:30.305
I think

04:30.705 --> 04:32.170
the testimonies are true.

04:33.255 --> 04:35.455
Even if Wang Xianzhi was
in the capital that night,

04:36.005 --> 04:37.530
he might not be the assassin.

04:38.430 --> 04:39.570
Honestly,

04:40.080 --> 04:41.231
Her Grace

04:41.255 --> 04:42.855
had excellent swordsmanship.

04:43.530 --> 04:45.405
But if Wang Xianzhi fought her,

04:46.130 --> 04:47.730
she wouldn't have left
the capital alive.

04:47.770 --> 04:50.130
It at least proves
that Wang Xianzhi was involved.

04:52.355 --> 04:54.280
I guess this is why

04:55.130 --> 04:56.506
the wooden box
was suddenly given to you.

04:56.530 --> 04:57.530
I understand.

04:58.205 --> 04:59.980
I'm going to Wudi City.

05:00.280 --> 05:02.205
When I see this and get disturbed,

05:02.505 --> 05:04.430
I'll fight Wang Xianzhi directly.

05:04.680 --> 05:06.081
Then, the trick to get me killed
by Wang Xianzhi

05:06.105 --> 05:07.105
will be achieved.

05:07.430 --> 05:08.430
Your Highness.

05:08.630 --> 05:10.155
I'm glad you understand that.

05:10.430 --> 05:13.080
(Biography of Wu Su)

05:15.580 --> 05:17.705
But this is a clue, anyway.

05:18.555 --> 05:19.905
Over the years,

05:20.480 --> 05:22.605
the truth is finally beginning
to come out.

05:27.130 --> 05:28.630
I protected Huangman'er

05:29.055 --> 05:30.655
and my sisters

05:32.380 --> 05:34.230
because I promised my mother

05:34.630 --> 05:36.290
that I would defend our family for her.

05:37.505 --> 05:39.505
My mother is still in my heart.

05:39.930 --> 05:41.355
She's watching me.

05:43.655 --> 05:45.055
I won't let her down.

05:45.605 --> 05:47.730
I'll find out who murdered her.

05:48.805 --> 05:49.955
Your Highness.

05:51.505 --> 05:52.505
I'm all right.

05:54.805 --> 05:55.805
I'm just...

05:56.230 --> 05:57.930
I'm just a bit disturbed

05:58.755 --> 06:00.515
when I've found a clue
after all the trouble.

06:01.280 --> 06:02.370
Don't worry, Grandpa Wei.

06:03.230 --> 06:04.250
I won't do silly things

06:04.505 --> 06:05.505
or act on impulse.

06:06.580 --> 06:07.930
Leave me alone for a while.

06:08.330 --> 06:10.010
I'll think about the whole story.

06:13.430 --> 06:14.605
If you need anything,

06:15.005 --> 06:16.281
let me know.

06:16.305 --> 06:17.305
I will.

06:31.280 --> 06:33.705
(Biography of Wu Su)

07:20.330 --> 07:21.855
Why is the dragon gone?

07:34.230 --> 07:35.230
Senior Li?

07:38.405 --> 07:39.405
Grandpa Wei?

08:03.380 --> 08:06.530
(Biography of Wu Su)

08:35.380 --> 08:39.506
(I've been an immortal for 180 years.
I haven't killed a single person.)

08:39.530 --> 08:43.355
(The Heaven's Charm isn't given yet.
I stay by the steam of Mount Longhu.)

10:12.330 --> 10:13.330
Mother?

11:22.580 --> 11:23.580
Mother!

11:37.930 --> 11:38.930
Fengnian.

12:36.255 --> 12:37.415
Those who cross Heaven's Gate

12:37.490 --> 12:38.681
can override all mortals.

12:38.705 --> 12:39.905
But I'm not convinced.

12:40.230 --> 12:42.050
I'm not convinced
that destiny controls life,

12:42.330 --> 12:44.055
that we can't fight against fate,

12:44.430 --> 12:46.570
that man can't conquer nature,

12:46.730 --> 12:48.450
or that the Unity can be immortal.

12:48.605 --> 12:49.946
I can use my sword

12:49.970 --> 12:51.250
to break open the Heaven's Gate.

12:51.705 --> 12:53.956
Even if demons and immortals
come to the mortal world,

12:53.980 --> 12:55.970
I'll kill them with my sword!

12:56.210 --> 12:57.255
I can cut off the destiny

12:57.480 --> 12:58.530
and remove the shackles.

12:59.455 --> 13:00.706
With the unyielding spirit,

13:00.730 --> 13:02.780
I can cut off all the hesitation

13:02.880 --> 13:04.880
and fear in my heart.

13:13.505 --> 13:16.580
Go away, destiny!

13:25.805 --> 13:27.450
I have a blade,

13:28.730 --> 13:30.690
to kill the dragon!

14:07.155 --> 14:08.905
I have a blade,

14:09.905 --> 14:12.105
to kill the Unity!

15:15.810 --> 15:16.810
Mother.

15:53.055 --> 15:56.205
(Biography of Wu Su)

16:06.005 --> 16:08.730
(Biography of Wu Su)

16:31.505 --> 16:32.830
So, it's a dream?

16:39.930 --> 16:41.410
You didn't expect to see me, did you?

16:45.080 --> 16:46.080
Hey.

16:46.180 --> 16:47.430
Time to yell for help.

16:48.705 --> 16:49.780
You're wounded?

16:52.630 --> 16:54.186
I fought with someone by the cliff.

16:54.210 --> 16:55.330
Not a big problem.

16:57.355 --> 16:58.505
Were there a lot of people

16:59.305 --> 17:00.305
by the cliff?

17:00.580 --> 17:01.205
Mm.

17:01.255 --> 17:02.255
A lot of them.

17:02.280 --> 17:03.605
They all came to kill you.

17:03.880 --> 17:05.030
You're sought after.

17:06.830 --> 17:08.180
Where's the man who hurt you?

17:08.655 --> 17:09.655
Off the cliff.

17:55.250 --> 17:57.330
Running into an insane girl
is the biggest trouble.

17:58.380 --> 18:00.905
Hope Mr. Zhao Huangchao's plan
will work.

18:02.355 --> 18:03.405
The day is breaking.

18:03.780 --> 18:05.100
The fight last night was in vain.

18:11.180 --> 18:12.180
Go.

18:12.805 --> 18:13.855
Let's go for breakfast.

18:20.850 --> 18:21.970
Don't you yell for help yet?

18:22.155 --> 18:23.315
I'm really going to kill you.

18:26.055 --> 18:27.450
The sun is coming out.

18:35.430 --> 18:36.555
In a little while,

18:38.105 --> 18:39.385
the sunrise will be spectacular.

18:48.805 --> 18:50.570
Shall we enjoy the scenery

18:51.155 --> 18:52.405
before the fight?

18:56.250 --> 18:57.250
Why not?

19:06.705 --> 19:08.005
It's indeed spectacular.

19:23.055 --> 19:24.210
Why are you crying?

19:26.680 --> 19:28.330
I dreamed of my mother.

19:32.880 --> 19:33.880
She...

19:34.380 --> 19:35.705
She's gorgeous, isn't she?

19:38.780 --> 19:40.330
You're handsome.

19:40.630 --> 19:42.010
Your mother must be beautiful.

19:48.755 --> 19:50.105
Over the years,

19:53.370 --> 19:55.170
I don't want to believe

19:56.730 --> 19:58.090
that she's dead.

20:01.480 --> 20:02.755
I always think

20:04.655 --> 20:06.255
that she's living in my heart.

20:09.180 --> 20:11.330
Actually, I'm deceiving myself.

20:14.155 --> 20:15.370
What makes you say that?

20:18.755 --> 20:20.780
She bade farewell to me in my dream.

20:23.405 --> 20:24.655
She died.

20:27.730 --> 20:28.930
A long time ago.

20:31.330 --> 20:32.855
I just didn't accept the truth

20:34.055 --> 20:35.630
until now.

20:37.680 --> 20:38.955
Did you bid farewell to her

20:39.430 --> 20:40.690
in your dream?

20:42.755 --> 20:44.010
It was too late.

20:54.805 --> 20:56.305
The scenery is beautiful today.

20:56.805 --> 20:58.305
For its sake,

20:58.555 --> 20:59.595
I'm not going to kill you.

21:02.605 --> 21:04.250
Why do you insist on killing me?

21:05.630 --> 21:07.650
I don't believe you do that
for the gold only.

21:12.430 --> 21:13.430
See you.

21:17.605 --> 21:18.850
It's not too late.

21:21.355 --> 21:22.355
Excuse me?

21:22.755 --> 21:23.810
Farewell.

21:24.105 --> 21:25.386
As long as you bid farewell to her,

21:25.410 --> 21:27.380
she will hear you.

21:42.130 --> 21:43.130
Mother,

21:48.380 --> 21:49.380
farewell.

21:54.655 --> 21:56.066
(Biography of Wu Su)
This is the dragon

21:56.090 --> 21:57.256
(Biography of Wu Su)
you saw in your dream.

21:57.280 --> 21:58.810
Did some patterns

21:58.880 --> 21:59.970
and a picture

22:00.380 --> 22:01.490
get me into a dream?

22:01.730 --> 22:02.810
They only worked on you.

22:03.280 --> 22:04.187
The one who prepared this

22:04.211 --> 22:05.850
must have known you very well.

22:05.880 --> 22:06.682
Did he do this

22:06.706 --> 22:08.770
only to make His Highness
have a nightmare?

22:08.880 --> 22:10.146
He wanted to use the nightmare

22:10.170 --> 22:11.226
to ruin the dependence and reliance

22:11.250 --> 22:13.105
in your heart.

22:13.905 --> 22:16.330
I guess in your heart,
your mother is the most important.

22:17.080 --> 22:17.657
Right.

22:17.681 --> 22:19.706
He wanted to attack you spiritually

22:19.730 --> 22:21.231
so that you would break down
and become desperate.

22:21.255 --> 22:22.680
How did you get over it?

22:24.155 --> 22:25.355
I destroyed them in my dream.

22:26.555 --> 22:27.831
If you hadn't taught me

22:27.855 --> 22:29.290
Open the Heaven's Gate,

22:29.530 --> 22:31.080
I wouldn't have managed to do that.

22:32.430 --> 22:34.850
Not everybody can make it.

22:35.305 --> 22:36.430
Now that you've got over it,

22:36.530 --> 22:38.106
no tricks of this kind

22:38.130 --> 22:39.730
can influence you anymore.

22:43.655 --> 22:45.386
But who do you think

22:45.410 --> 22:46.730
sent this to us?

22:47.080 --> 22:48.370
No matter who sent it,

22:50.105 --> 22:51.170
he'll come again.

22:55.930 --> 22:56.930
Let's set out.

22:57.250 --> 22:58.480
To Mount Longhu!

23:09.205 --> 23:10.905
His Majesty summoned you to the palace.

23:14.605 --> 23:17.105
His Majesty summoned you to the palace.

23:19.255 --> 23:20.580
Let me sleep for a bit longer.

23:21.905 --> 23:22.955
Why did His Majesty

23:23.255 --> 23:25.546
summon me at this time of day?

23:25.570 --> 23:27.010
An urgent message came from Yangzhou

23:27.205 --> 23:30.880
that your son met Cao Changqing
in Yangcheng.

23:32.330 --> 23:34.080
One of the top three martial artists?

23:35.255 --> 23:38.146
Your son's maid
is the princess of West Chu.

23:38.170 --> 23:39.555
You know that, don't you?

23:39.830 --> 23:40.457
I do.

23:40.481 --> 23:43.490
Then why do you keep her
in your mansion?

23:43.630 --> 23:44.981
When the princess

23:45.005 --> 23:46.130
serves as a maid,

23:46.170 --> 23:48.610
it's the pride of North Liang.

23:49.430 --> 23:50.806
Cao Changqing

23:50.830 --> 23:52.626
recognized the princess

23:52.650 --> 23:54.855
and fought your son!

23:55.180 --> 23:57.630
Li Chungang was around him, wasn't he?

23:58.805 --> 24:01.786
Li Chungang and Cao Changqing

24:01.810 --> 24:04.186
had a fight, but neither of them won.

24:04.210 --> 24:05.746
Before Cao Changqing left, he said

24:05.770 --> 24:07.810
that he would go back to West Shu.

24:08.055 --> 24:09.746
Your son's maid

24:09.770 --> 24:11.450
would be the queen.

24:13.755 --> 24:16.410
When the queen serves as his maid,

24:17.130 --> 24:19.056
he'll be imposing.

24:19.080 --> 24:20.410
Imposing?

24:20.830 --> 24:23.370
Evidence shows

24:23.555 --> 24:24.946
that Jiang Ni

24:24.970 --> 24:28.066
has been trying to kill Xu Fengnian
since she was little.

24:28.090 --> 24:28.907
Looks like

24:28.931 --> 24:31.026
she hates him a lot.

24:31.050 --> 24:32.210
My son

24:32.505 --> 24:34.456
will be stuck in romance tricks.

24:34.480 --> 24:35.610
Girls all hate him.

24:35.890 --> 24:37.755
Do you get it?

24:38.105 --> 24:42.370
The new queen of West Chu
wants to kill Xu Fengnian.

24:42.930 --> 24:44.426
At last, I can

24:44.450 --> 24:46.170
have a sound sleep.

24:46.580 --> 24:48.250
Seriously?

24:48.855 --> 24:49.756
Xu Xiao!

24:49.780 --> 24:50.706
Ouch.

24:50.730 --> 24:51.406
Don't yell.

24:51.430 --> 24:52.147
Come on.

24:52.171 --> 24:53.426
Lie down with me.

24:53.450 --> 24:54.450
Come on.

25:07.210 --> 25:08.210
The wind is rising.

25:09.755 --> 25:10.755
Any problem?

25:31.930 --> 25:32.930
Jiang Ni?

25:33.780 --> 25:34.810
Keep your voice down.

25:35.930 --> 25:37.605
Cao Changqing made the wind rise?

25:38.370 --> 25:40.256
I asked him to cover me

25:40.280 --> 25:41.706
so that I could sneak back.

25:41.730 --> 25:43.930
I thought Cao Changqing would stop you
from coming back.

25:44.030 --> 25:45.106
When you're in danger,

25:45.130 --> 25:46.226
Cao Changqing won't help to save you

25:46.250 --> 25:47.946
unless Jiang Ni is around you.

25:47.970 --> 25:48.970
Do you get it?

25:49.050 --> 25:50.405
I came back to ask you for money.

25:51.580 --> 25:53.370
I've served as your maid
for so many years.

25:53.730 --> 25:54.707
When I have to leave,

25:54.731 --> 25:56.530
shouldn't you give me some allowance?

25:59.080 --> 26:00.290
When you're really leaving,

26:00.455 --> 26:01.455
I'll give it to you.

26:02.080 --> 26:04.005
I've promised Mr. Chess Master

26:04.155 --> 26:06.055
that after you leave
Mount Longhu safely,

26:06.205 --> 26:08.055
I'm going to West Shu.

26:08.705 --> 26:09.705
Anyway,

26:10.210 --> 26:11.580
he also said

26:12.030 --> 26:13.546
that our residence in West Shu

26:13.570 --> 26:15.090
would be a good thing for North Liang.

26:15.605 --> 26:17.105
I would rather that you stayed.

26:28.155 --> 26:30.305
So that you could order me about?

26:34.630 --> 26:35.630
All right.

26:36.355 --> 26:37.530
You should be careful.

26:37.680 --> 26:39.626
Except those who you trust,

26:39.650 --> 26:40.666
don't let anyone know

26:40.690 --> 26:41.690
that I'm back.

26:41.930 --> 26:42.930
Mm.

26:44.280 --> 26:44.987
What about Yu Youwei?

26:45.011 --> 26:46.755
She's staying with Mr. Chess Master.

26:47.010 --> 26:48.280
He said

26:48.805 --> 26:50.930
he would tell her

26:50.980 --> 26:52.405
about all supporters of West Chu.

26:52.855 --> 26:55.155
She'll be my lady-in-waiting.

26:58.405 --> 26:59.970
Her Grace isn't noticed, is she?

27:00.480 --> 27:02.655
What if I kill Xu Fengnian?

27:03.830 --> 27:04.547
Without a reason,

27:04.571 --> 27:05.955
why must you kill Xu Fengnian?

27:06.405 --> 27:08.030
When Her Grace has her way to go,

27:08.855 --> 27:10.730
she can't be stuck in love affairs.

27:11.630 --> 27:13.105
Only a loner

27:13.405 --> 27:14.930
can establish the monarchy.

27:16.705 --> 27:17.705
Nonsense.

27:22.330 --> 27:23.480
I made a slip of the tongue.

27:23.555 --> 27:24.705
I didn't mean that.

27:25.155 --> 27:26.205
I get it.

27:28.005 --> 27:29.580
I won't kill Xu Fengnian, then.

27:33.580 --> 27:34.905
When Li Chungang is around,

27:36.180 --> 27:37.500
I can't kill Xu Fengnian, anyway.

27:43.005 --> 27:44.005
Xu Xiao?

27:44.380 --> 27:46.730
When His Majesty has summoned you,

27:46.880 --> 27:48.970
there'll be a result

27:49.080 --> 27:50.480
for your son's inheritance problem.

27:50.705 --> 27:52.786
But you're ignoring His Majesty.

27:52.810 --> 27:53.380
What...?

27:53.655 --> 27:55.305
What do you want?

27:55.610 --> 27:57.130
I don't want to do anything.

27:58.170 --> 28:00.730
He's kept me here for so many days
without seeing me.

28:00.980 --> 28:02.546
Why can't I keep him waiting, too?

28:02.570 --> 28:05.690
It's not time to be angry
with His Majesty.

28:06.630 --> 28:08.850
Why don't you understand?

28:10.955 --> 28:13.050
The more arrogant I pretend to be,

28:13.480 --> 28:15.370
the more relieved His Majesty will feel.

28:15.610 --> 28:16.610
All right. All right.

28:16.730 --> 28:18.250
You always make sense.

28:19.880 --> 28:21.330
If you still don't go,

28:21.455 --> 28:22.626
the carriages from the palace

28:22.650 --> 28:24.605
will block the gate.

28:27.005 --> 28:28.005
What?

28:28.680 --> 28:30.770
Why are you lying down again?

28:30.905 --> 28:31.747
You're right.

28:31.771 --> 28:32.880
I shouldn't push it.

28:33.530 --> 28:35.410
Let's go to the palace.

28:35.530 --> 28:36.227
Oh, yes.

28:36.251 --> 28:37.305
That's great.

28:39.970 --> 28:41.410
Be patient.

28:42.505 --> 28:43.986
You were tricked

28:44.010 --> 28:45.050
and caught in a nightmare?

28:45.280 --> 28:46.170
Who did that?

28:46.255 --> 28:47.505
This is what confuses me.

28:47.680 --> 28:49.720
I can't figure out
who's capable enough to trick me.

28:52.180 --> 28:53.346
Why are you staring at me?

28:53.370 --> 28:54.426
He's an idiot.

28:54.450 --> 28:56.250
And he isn't experienced
in the martial world.

28:56.405 --> 28:58.431
It makes sense
that he can't recognize martial tricks.

28:58.455 --> 28:59.455
But what about you?

28:59.555 --> 29:00.506
You're the God of Sword.

29:00.530 --> 29:01.506
You have no idea, too?

29:01.530 --> 29:02.155
I...

29:02.430 --> 29:03.546
I've been hiding under Tingchao Pavilion

29:03.570 --> 29:04.746
for so many years.

29:04.770 --> 29:05.427
How do I know

29:05.451 --> 29:06.930
what masters have appeared

29:06.970 --> 29:07.857
in the martial world in recent years?

29:07.881 --> 29:09.930
I'll go ask Mr. Chess Master later.

29:10.130 --> 29:11.370
What about the female assassin?

29:11.480 --> 29:12.666
Why didn't she kill you at that time?

29:12.690 --> 29:13.730
I don't think

29:13.905 --> 29:15.630
she wanted to kill me.

29:17.055 --> 29:18.370
Let's think about it.

29:18.855 --> 29:20.030
Did she hurt me twice

29:20.405 --> 29:21.450
just to kill me?

29:21.580 --> 29:22.666
After she assassinated me
for the first time,

29:22.690 --> 29:23.610
I rose from the dead.

29:23.655 --> 29:25.106
I absorbed the genuine spirit forcibly

29:25.130 --> 29:26.890
and enhanced Dahuangting
to the fourth level.

29:26.955 --> 29:27.955
And then,

29:28.280 --> 29:29.600
she assassinated me in Yangcheng.

29:29.655 --> 29:30.786
As the saying goes,

29:30.810 --> 29:31.866
fortune and misfortune are intertwined.

29:31.890 --> 29:32.890
Your wound

29:33.090 --> 29:34.780
would be helpful, anyway.

29:34.955 --> 29:36.466
When I killed Liu Liting in Yangcheng,

29:36.490 --> 29:37.730
I could have caused problems.

29:38.155 --> 29:39.506
But her assassination

29:39.530 --> 29:40.890
caught the Lu Family in a dilemma.

29:41.055 --> 29:42.027
Just because I was wounded,

29:42.051 --> 29:43.570
the crisis was defused.

29:43.655 --> 29:45.030
Two assassinations

29:45.155 --> 29:46.690
were helpful to me.

29:46.805 --> 29:48.506
So, you think she's been helping you?

29:48.530 --> 29:49.666
Before today's sunrise,

29:49.690 --> 29:51.130
she had the best chance to kill me.

29:52.005 --> 29:53.130
But she didn't.

29:53.605 --> 29:54.755
Could it be

29:54.980 --> 29:56.610
another arrangement of Xu Xiao's?

29:56.755 --> 29:57.805
I don't know.

29:58.755 --> 30:00.205
As I'm going east,

30:00.855 --> 30:01.667
I feel

30:01.691 --> 30:03.410
that I just can't see through Xu Xiao.

30:03.852 --> 30:06.630
(The Imperial Study
of the Imperial Palace of Liyang)

30:19.705 --> 30:22.355
You came early, Prime Minister Zhang.

30:35.305 --> 30:36.305
Mm?

30:36.930 --> 30:37.955
Who else is coming?

30:42.780 --> 30:46.205
His Majesty also summoned
General Gu Jiantang.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.480
Unfortunately,

30:48.605 --> 30:50.570
he's having a recurrence of the wound.

30:51.005 --> 30:52.005
Today,

30:52.205 --> 30:53.370
he can't come.

30:55.630 --> 30:57.186
Of course, a coward like him

30:57.210 --> 30:58.490
doesn't dare to come and see me.

31:00.210 --> 31:01.490
During the national wars,

31:01.890 --> 31:03.106
there were four famous generals.

31:03.130 --> 31:05.930
Gu Jiantang is as famous as you.

31:06.680 --> 31:08.280
After Liyang ruled the world,

31:09.055 --> 31:10.146
you settled

31:10.170 --> 31:11.410
in North Liang

31:11.555 --> 31:13.050
and became the lord.

31:13.370 --> 31:14.681
Gu Jiantang, however,

31:14.705 --> 31:16.050
abandoned his troops

31:16.355 --> 31:17.690
and came to the capital alone.

31:17.855 --> 31:19.355
For national affairs,

31:20.050 --> 31:22.055
he has been straining every nerve.

31:22.680 --> 31:24.306
Our people

31:24.330 --> 31:25.430
will judge

31:25.980 --> 31:27.481
who is loyal and who is treacherous.

31:27.505 --> 31:28.570
Without doubt,

31:28.705 --> 31:29.786
a sinister man

31:29.810 --> 31:31.050
like Gu Jiantang

31:31.630 --> 31:32.730
is the most loyal.

31:33.030 --> 31:34.030
So,

31:34.405 --> 31:36.130
maybe he can be

31:36.530 --> 31:38.490
the best candidate

31:38.780 --> 31:40.530
to take over North Liang.

31:51.155 --> 31:52.315
If he takes over North Liang,

31:53.380 --> 31:54.630
will His Majesty

31:55.705 --> 31:56.780
feel relieved?

31:58.405 --> 31:59.970
Don't gossip about His Majesty.

32:00.155 --> 32:01.155
Oh.

32:01.480 --> 32:02.480
I'll say no more.

32:03.530 --> 32:04.530
Where's His Majesty?

32:04.705 --> 32:05.666
He summoned me.

32:05.690 --> 32:06.450
Why hasn't he appeared yet?

32:06.555 --> 32:08.155
His Majesty is feeling unwell

32:08.455 --> 32:10.830
and he won't see you.

32:14.230 --> 32:15.980
Then why did he summon me?

32:17.155 --> 32:18.455
Here's an oral instruction.

32:19.805 --> 32:21.405
His Majesty wants to ask you a question.

32:21.455 --> 32:23.210
If your son takes over North Liang

32:23.255 --> 32:25.810
and inherits the throne of North Liang,

32:25.955 --> 32:28.850
do you still want to be Grand Commander?

32:37.080 --> 32:38.255
When doing business,

32:39.005 --> 32:40.245
people gain some and lose some.

32:41.230 --> 32:41.850
I understand.

32:42.080 --> 32:43.430
What do you understand?

32:46.180 --> 32:48.930
I'm too old and muddleheaded

32:49.180 --> 32:50.450
to take such an important post.

32:50.580 --> 32:52.330
Tomorrow, I'll submit a report

32:52.905 --> 32:55.306
to resign as Grand Commander.

32:55.330 --> 32:56.330
Good.

32:58.730 --> 32:59.850
According to His Majesty,

33:00.080 --> 33:03.530
you don't need to kneel for this.

33:24.680 --> 33:27.331
Now that you resign as Grand Commander,

33:27.355 --> 33:28.506
the throne of North Liang

33:28.530 --> 33:30.555
should be inherited by your son.

33:30.905 --> 33:32.580
The North Liang Army

33:33.455 --> 33:34.855
will still belong to the Xu Family.

33:40.155 --> 33:43.195
(Xu Fengnian is permitted to inherit
the hereditary throne of North Liang...)

33:52.705 --> 33:54.330
This is a national affair.

33:55.005 --> 33:57.055
Do you really take it
as a business deal?

33:58.280 --> 33:59.520
Don't be angry, Prime Minister.

33:59.605 --> 34:00.880
His Majesty said

34:01.180 --> 34:02.866
that North Mang cast covetous eyes on us

34:02.890 --> 34:04.930
and the people of West Chu
wanted to make trouble.

34:05.455 --> 34:07.650
We're threatened by growing crises.

34:08.055 --> 34:09.055
We need

34:09.255 --> 34:10.866
North Liang Army to defend the world

34:10.890 --> 34:12.370
and relieve worries from His Majesty.

34:13.355 --> 34:15.330
The hereditary system of North Liang

34:15.805 --> 34:17.906
will cause trouble in the future.

34:17.930 --> 34:18.930
I...

34:19.105 --> 34:20.850
I ask to see His Majesty.

34:20.980 --> 34:22.210
His Majesty is feeling unwell

34:22.655 --> 34:23.830
and he won't see you.

34:24.705 --> 34:25.705
One more thing.

34:26.180 --> 34:27.290
His Majesty ordered

34:27.530 --> 34:28.650
that Prime Minister Zhang

34:28.680 --> 34:31.490
should be the witness of this case.

34:31.580 --> 34:33.090
In the future,

34:33.380 --> 34:37.130
no officials shall
make improper comments.

34:39.330 --> 34:40.955
How can we stop others

34:41.580 --> 34:42.880
from commenting?

34:44.055 --> 34:45.480
No one else can stop them.

34:47.080 --> 34:48.980
But you can, of course.

34:50.505 --> 34:52.955
Looks like in His Majesty's eyes,

34:53.430 --> 34:54.690
Prime Minister Zhang,

34:55.030 --> 34:57.605
you can awe all the other officials.

34:58.105 --> 34:59.690
His Majesty thinks so highly of you.

34:59.955 --> 35:01.330
I'm indeed jealous.

35:05.255 --> 35:06.255
I...

35:06.755 --> 35:08.330
I've been racking my brains

35:08.780 --> 35:11.480
for the prosperity of Liyang.

35:12.105 --> 35:15.530
God knows how loyal I am.

35:15.905 --> 35:16.905
Mm.

35:17.105 --> 35:18.186
Don't worry, Prime Minister.

35:18.210 --> 35:19.230
I'll tell His Majesty

35:19.450 --> 35:21.210
what you just said.

35:31.155 --> 35:32.155
Han Shengxuan,

35:33.130 --> 35:35.346
North Liang still belongs to my family.

35:35.370 --> 35:36.630
What do you think of it?

35:37.630 --> 35:38.905
Thank you, My Lord,

35:39.180 --> 35:41.005
for remembering my name.

35:42.330 --> 35:43.866
The ownership of North Liang

35:43.890 --> 35:45.630
is a national affair.

35:45.805 --> 35:47.650
I don't dare to comment.

35:47.755 --> 35:49.930
People call you Han Diaosi.

35:52.130 --> 35:53.730
After this name is used for a long time,

35:53.755 --> 35:55.930
don't forget

35:56.055 --> 35:57.215
your real name Han Shengxuan.

35:59.280 --> 36:00.850
I'm from a humble family.

36:01.250 --> 36:02.406
I don't dare to forget my real name.

36:02.430 --> 36:03.105
Mm.

36:03.450 --> 36:04.450
A man

36:04.805 --> 36:05.805
should not

36:05.980 --> 36:07.050
forget his origin.

36:07.405 --> 36:08.090
Also,

36:08.380 --> 36:10.005
he should not overstep his authority.

36:13.205 --> 36:14.480
I'll keep in mind

36:15.480 --> 36:16.610
your instruction, My Lord.

36:17.980 --> 36:20.770
Hereditament. Hereditament.

36:21.170 --> 36:22.980
A lot of people tried to stop it,

36:23.980 --> 36:25.080
but I made it at last.

36:25.355 --> 36:26.406
Shouldn't you congratulate me?

36:26.430 --> 36:27.256
Congratulations.

36:27.280 --> 36:27.757
Mm.

36:27.781 --> 36:28.970
Congratulations.

36:30.105 --> 36:31.105
All right.

36:31.405 --> 36:32.770
I'm going back to North Liang.

36:53.805 --> 36:54.805
His Majesty

36:55.255 --> 36:57.130
indeed approved of the hereditament

36:57.330 --> 36:58.730
for North Liang.

37:03.380 --> 37:04.431
(Zhao Danping, Longhu Arch-Taoist)
What will Xu Xiao exchange

37:04.455 --> 37:05.306
(Zhao Danping, Longhu Arch-Taoist)

37:05.330 --> 37:06.666
(Zhao Danping, Longhu Arch-Taoist)
for that?

37:06.690 --> 37:08.755
He resigned as Grand Commander.

37:09.570 --> 37:11.930
Grand Commander is a glorious position,

37:12.305 --> 37:13.930
but he has no power.

37:14.730 --> 37:16.630
There's growing unrest in West Chu.

37:17.405 --> 37:20.605
His Majesty certainly wants stability
in North Liang.

37:24.455 --> 37:26.706
But he's nursing a viper in his bosom.

37:26.730 --> 37:27.730
What about Gu Jiantang?

37:27.855 --> 37:28.930
Didn't he say anything?

37:29.330 --> 37:31.490
He took a sickie.

37:31.555 --> 37:33.666
Is he going to stay in the capital

37:33.690 --> 37:35.450
for the rest of his life?

37:35.530 --> 37:36.605
I guess

37:37.705 --> 37:40.780
His Majesty will make him
Grand Commander.

37:41.505 --> 37:42.610
His Majesty

37:42.655 --> 37:45.530
doesn't want Gu Jiantang
to leave the capital

37:46.255 --> 37:48.805
in case of calamity for the future.

37:50.080 --> 37:52.705
Will we just watch the Xu Family

37:52.890 --> 37:55.380
rule North Liang
from generation to generation?

37:56.005 --> 37:58.290
His Majesty approved
of the Hereditament,

37:59.380 --> 38:01.230
but it doesn't mean

38:01.630 --> 38:03.930
Xu Fengnian can live
until he takes over North Liang.

38:06.655 --> 38:09.030
Among Four Longhu Arch-Taoists,

38:09.580 --> 38:11.505
only you can stay in the capital

38:12.230 --> 38:14.330
all year round.

38:14.655 --> 38:15.690
Over the years,

38:16.030 --> 38:17.650
you've written

38:17.850 --> 38:19.090
a lot of sacrificial articles.

38:20.405 --> 38:22.010
Aren't you fed up?

38:24.570 --> 38:25.930
There's no future for Mount Longhu

38:26.455 --> 38:30.050
unless the court is in peace.

38:30.530 --> 38:32.530
If Xu Fengnian takes over North Liang,

38:33.155 --> 38:34.186
it won't be a good thing

38:34.210 --> 38:35.210
for the world

38:36.130 --> 38:38.230
or Mount Longhu.

38:40.405 --> 38:42.405
You want me to go back to Mount Longhu

38:42.970 --> 38:44.705
and kill Xu Fengnian?

38:48.305 --> 38:50.130
There are four Longhu Arch-Taoists.

38:50.655 --> 38:51.730
Zhao Xituan.

38:52.055 --> 38:53.370
He's your brother's master.

38:53.405 --> 38:55.250
He'll show some respect to you, I guess.

38:55.405 --> 38:57.090
Zhao Danping is the worst-tempered.

38:57.370 --> 38:58.730
He resides in the capital,

38:59.050 --> 39:00.680
known as Scholar of Sacrificial Article.

39:01.080 --> 39:02.946
He hasn't been back
to Mount Longhu for years.

39:02.970 --> 39:04.610
You don't need
to worry about him, either.

39:05.290 --> 39:06.650
You should pay attention

39:06.755 --> 39:09.410
to Zhao Xiyi
who has the highest seniority.

39:09.450 --> 39:10.210
Also,

39:10.330 --> 39:11.930
pay attention to Zhao Danxia,

39:12.030 --> 39:13.905
Chief of Arch-Taoists' Office

39:14.355 --> 39:15.506
and the most powerful leader of Taoism.

39:15.530 --> 39:17.730
They two are horrible enough.

39:19.850 --> 39:21.030
Xu Fengnian

39:21.890 --> 39:23.055
is Xu Xiao's son.

39:23.605 --> 39:24.610
If we really kill him,

39:25.030 --> 39:27.805
Xu Xiao will lead his army
to Mount Longhu!

39:28.005 --> 39:30.290
You don't need to kill him personally.

39:30.755 --> 39:32.570
But he must die.

39:37.380 --> 39:38.480
This concerns

39:39.580 --> 39:42.405
the destiny of Liyang.

39:47.255 --> 39:48.805
Now that

39:49.305 --> 39:52.480
you reap benefits from the court,

39:53.530 --> 39:54.570
you should

39:55.255 --> 39:56.730
perform your duty loyally.

39:58.455 --> 39:59.455
By the way,

40:00.955 --> 40:02.370
besides Xu Fengnian,

40:03.105 --> 40:04.690
you should kill one more person.

40:05.855 --> 40:06.855
Who?

40:08.855 --> 40:09.855
Zhao Kai.

40:11.855 --> 40:13.010
Who's he?

40:13.770 --> 40:15.250
He's Han Diaosi's disciple

40:15.755 --> 40:17.890
and the illegitimate son of His Majesty.

40:19.930 --> 40:20.930
Now,

40:21.155 --> 40:23.830
he's hunting down Xu Fengnian.

40:36.450 --> 40:38.290
The illegitimate son of His Majesty?

40:41.205 --> 40:42.450
Han Diaosi

40:42.955 --> 40:44.890
pretends to cooperate with me.

40:45.450 --> 40:48.210
Actually, he wants to kill Xu Fengnian

40:49.780 --> 40:51.650
and cause chaos in the world

40:51.880 --> 40:56.530
so that Zhao Kai can fight
for the throne.

40:58.755 --> 40:59.970
He thinks

41:00.905 --> 41:03.010
I'm ignorant of his plan.

41:06.305 --> 41:09.970
I've been doing everything

41:10.630 --> 41:12.530
for the eternal peace

41:12.780 --> 41:14.650
of Liyang.

41:17.155 --> 41:18.986
Xu Fengnian is the bane.

41:19.010 --> 41:20.010
He must be killed.

41:21.130 --> 41:22.170
Zhao Kai

41:22.855 --> 41:24.370
will also cause chaos.

41:24.630 --> 41:26.890
You can kill him, too.

41:27.050 --> 41:28.155
Prime Minister,

41:29.880 --> 41:31.530
he's an illegitimate son.

41:32.105 --> 41:34.290
But he's a prince, anyway.

41:34.605 --> 41:36.250
When you want to assassinate a prince,

41:38.405 --> 41:40.165
have you thought about

41:40.430 --> 41:41.730
how you may end up?

41:44.630 --> 41:46.410
I fight for the destiny of Liyang,

41:47.255 --> 41:48.610
and I can't care about

41:48.955 --> 41:51.130
my own destiny.

41:53.730 --> 41:55.530
If Han Diaosi

41:56.580 --> 41:58.535
knows about this,

41:58.930 --> 42:00.970
he won't let you go.

42:01.330 --> 42:02.570
He's a mere eunuch,

42:03.355 --> 42:05.530
but he wants to cause big chaos.

42:05.780 --> 42:07.290
He won't let me go.

42:07.880 --> 42:10.305
I won't let him go, either.

42:14.180 --> 42:14.930
But...

42:15.105 --> 42:16.105
Say no more.

42:16.555 --> 42:18.170
I'll handle the problems in court.

42:19.530 --> 42:20.850
You shall take care of problems

42:21.630 --> 42:23.010
in the martial world.

42:25.155 --> 42:26.410
Zhao Danping.

42:26.555 --> 42:27.555
Mm?

42:28.630 --> 42:30.055
Whose side

42:31.255 --> 42:33.605
will your sect be on?

42:35.805 --> 42:36.850
Prime Minister,

42:37.705 --> 42:39.490
I'm going back
to Mount Longhu immediately.

42:40.480 --> 42:42.370
Xu Fengnian and Zhao Kai

42:43.005 --> 42:44.370
will be killed

42:44.855 --> 42:45.855
by us.

43:29.810 --> 43:32.530
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.305 --> 43:37.105
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.030 --> 43:41.950
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.030 --> 43:46.830
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.130 --> 43:51.030
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.730 --> 43:55.550
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.555 --> 44:00.310
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.330 --> 44:05.255
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.755 --> 44:08.486
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.510 --> 44:09.750
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.530 --> 44:14.390
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.205 --> 44:17.931
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:17.955 --> 44:19.390
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.880 --> 44:23.755
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.180 --> 44:25.531
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.555 --> 44:28.390
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.805 --> 44:31.286
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.310 --> 44:33.710
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.005 --> 44:36.031
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.055 --> 44:38.231
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.255 --> 44:42.470
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.830 --> 44:43.966
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:43.990 --> 44:47.030
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.205 --> 44:49.166
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.190 --> 44:51.910
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.470 --> 44:54.286
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.310 --> 44:56.806
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.830 --> 45:00.930
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
